WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : PIN Verified
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : PIN Incorrect
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingWithdrawal : User Approval
ProcessingWithdrawal --> Dispensing : Withdrawal Approved
Dispensing --> Printing : Cash Dispensed
Printing --> Ejecting : Receipt Printed
Ejecting --> Resetting : Card Returned
Resetting --> WaitingForPIN : Reset Complete
@enduml
